@startuml paired_consent_rotation
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
title Paired Consent Rotation Sequence Diagram

box "User Side" #AliceBlue
actor User order 1 #LightCyan
participant Niso order 2 #LightGreen
participant Boomlet order 3 #LightPink
participant ST order 4 #Violet
participant Boomletwo order 5 #LightGray
end box
autonumber "<b>[00]"

legend left
encrypt_for_<peer> and decrypt_from_<peer> use setup's CBC-CMAC directional channel keys,
the acting device's original identity key and its retained peer identity. Peer names bind
sender and receiver roles and key direction. Decryption authenticates before returning content.
endlegend

hnote over Boomlet, Boomletwo #Lavender:  Setup Step 26 initializes consent_counter := 0 and under_duress := false \n Copy their current values to Boomletwo in setup's authenticated state transfer \n Retain monotonic counter for identity lifetime \n Load protected state on restart; inactive Boomletwo uses its original identity key and confines the copied source key to SAR verification
hnote over Boomlet, Boomletwo #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet and Boomletwo preserve duress through the current withdrawal, or the next withdrawal after IDLE rotation. \n They clear it only after withdrawal end, exact final SAR receipt and paired reset; missing receipts preserve the flag and block new operations.

group Enter current set and approve rotation
' Step 1
User o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoInput1 \n magic: "consent_rotation_start"
' Step 2
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoBoomletMessage1 \n BEGIN_ROTATION()
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  In DIGGING, Boomlet finishes and sends any ping already under construction, then enters rotation at the start of the next iteration before its duress check and next ping construction. \n If digging ends before entry, Boomlet leaves the request unperformed. In IDLE, it starts immediately.
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert active source in IDLE or DIGGING; ST available; no pending attempt
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  rotation_id := random_bytes(32) \n consent_rotation_request := MessageWithNonce{content: consent_counter, nonce: rotation_id} \n duress_check_space := DuressCheckSpace{space: random_permutation([1..193])} \n consent_rotation_challenge := ConsentRotationChallenge{ \n request: consent_rotation_request, duress_check_space: duress_check_space} \n consent_rotation_challenge_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st := encrypt_for_st(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_current_set_challenge"), \n content: consent_rotation_challenge)
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet pauses consent operations and any DIGGING withdrawal through rotation, preserving the iteration and SAR duties.
' Step 3
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationBoomletNisoMessage1 \n consent_rotation_challenge_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
' Step 4
Niso o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoStMessage1 \n consent_rotation_challenge_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
hnote over ST #Lavender:  consent_rotation_challenge := decrypt_from_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_current_set_challenge"), \n envelope: consent_rotation_challenge_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st) \n consent_rotation_request := consent_rotation_challenge.request \n duress_check_space := consent_rotation_challenge.duress_check_space \n rotation_id := consent_rotation_request.nonce \n duress_display_columns, retained_display_maps := create_duress_display_columns(duress_check_space.space)
hnote over ST #LavenderBlush:  ST shows the rotation purpose; User approves the change by submitting these five choices.
' Step 5
ST o-> User:  <b>ConsentRotationStOutput1 \n magic: "change_consent_set_enter_current_set" \n duress_display_columns
hnote over User #Lavender:  user_selection := select_one_from_each(duress_display_columns)
' Step 6
User o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationStInput1 \n user_selection
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert count(user_selection) == 5 \n Assert user_selection contains exactly one displayed choice from each duress_display_columns column
hnote over ST #Lavender:  duress_signal_index := map_to_original_indices(user_selection, retained_display_maps) \n consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st := sign_message(st_0_identity_privkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/st_review", consent_rotation_request) \n consent_rotation_answer := ConsentRotationAnswer{ \n approval: consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st, duress_signal_index: duress_signal_index} \n consent_rotation_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0 := encrypt_for_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_current_set_answer"), \n content: consent_rotation_answer)
' Step 7
ST o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationStNisoMessage1 \n consent_rotation_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
' Step 8
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoBoomletMessage2 \n consent_rotation_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  consent_rotation_answer := decrypt_from_st(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_current_set_answer"), \n envelope: consent_rotation_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0) \n consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st := consent_rotation_answer.approval
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(st_0_identity_pubkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/st_review", \n consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st) == True \n Assert consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st.content == consent_rotation_challenge.request \n Assert consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st.content.content == consent_counter \n Assert count(consent_rotation_answer.duress_signal_index.indices) == 5 \n Assert consent_rotation_answer.duress_signal_index.indices are distinct and in range [1..193]
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  selected_consent_set := consent_rotation_challenge.duress_check_space.space[consent_rotation_answer.duress_signal_index.indices] \n answer_is_wrong := (selected_consent_set != duress_consent_set); compare all five \n under_duress := under_duress OR answer_is_wrong \n duress_check_space := DuressCheckSpace{space: random_permutation([1..193])} \n consent_set_query := MessageWithNonce{content: duress_check_space, nonce: rotation_id} \n consent_set_query_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st := encrypt_for_st(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_new_set_query"), \n content: consent_set_query)
end group

group Choose and confirm new set on ST
' Step 9
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationBoomletNisoMessage2 \n consent_set_query_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
' Step 10
Niso o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoStMessage2 \n consent_set_query_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
hnote over ST #Lavender:  consent_set_query := decrypt_from_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_new_set_query"), \n envelope: consent_set_query_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st)
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert consent_set_query.nonce == rotation_id \n Assert expected phase is new_set_input
hnote over ST #Lavender:  new_consent_counter := consent_rotation_request.content + 1 \n duress_check_space := consent_set_query.content \n duress_display_columns, retained_display_maps := create_duress_display_columns(duress_check_space.space)
' Step 11
ST o-> User:  <b>ConsentRotationStOutput2 \n magic: "choose_new_consent_set" \n pending_consent_counter: new_consent_counter \n duress_display_columns
hnote over User #Lavender:  user_selection := select_one_from_each(duress_display_columns)
' Step 12
User o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationStInput2 \n user_selection
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert count(user_selection) == 5 \n Assert user_selection contains exactly one displayed choice from each duress_display_columns column
hnote over ST #Lavender:  duress_signal_index := map_to_original_indices(user_selection, retained_display_maps) \n new_consent_set := duress_check_space.space[duress_signal_index.indices]
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert count(new_consent_set) == 5 \n Assert new_consent_set contains distinct countries in [1..193]
hnote over ST #Lavender:  duress_display_columns, retained_display_maps := create_duress_display_columns(duress_check_space.space)
loop Until selected countries match new_consent_set
' Step 13
ST o-> User:  <b>ConsentRotationStOutput3 \n magic: "confirm_new_consent_set" \n pending_consent_counter: new_consent_counter \n duress_display_columns
hnote over User #Lavender:  user_selection := select_one_from_each(duress_display_columns)
' Step 14
User o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationStInput3 \n user_selection
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert count(user_selection) == 5 \n Assert user_selection contains exactly one displayed choice from each duress_display_columns column
hnote over ST #Lavender:  duress_signal_index := map_to_original_indices(user_selection, retained_display_maps) \n selected_consent_set := duress_check_space.space[duress_signal_index.indices]
end
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert selected_consent_set == new_consent_set
hnote over ST #Lavender:  consent_set_answer := MessageWithNonce{content: duress_signal_index, nonce: rotation_id} \n consent_set_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0 := encrypt_for_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_new_set_answer"), \n content: consent_set_answer)
' Step 15
ST o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationStNisoMessage2 \n consent_set_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
' Step 16
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoBoomletMessage3 \n consent_set_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  consent_set_answer := decrypt_from_st(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_new_set_answer"), \n envelope: consent_set_answer_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0)
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert current stage is new_set_input \n Assert consent_set_answer.nonce == rotation_id \n Assert count(consent_set_answer.content.indices) == 5 \n Assert consent_set_answer.content.indices are distinct \n Assert consent_set_answer.content.indices are in range [1..193]
end group

group Send set and confirm receipt
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  new_consent_set := duress_check_space.space[consent_set_answer.content.indices] \n consent_set_change := ConsentSetChange{ \n approval: consent_rotation_request_signed_by_st, \n duress_consent_set: new_consent_set, under_duress: under_duress} \n consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0 := sign_message(boomlet_0_identity_privkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/consent_set", consent_set_change) \n consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo := encrypt_for_boomletwo(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_consent_set", setup_instance_id), \n content: consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0) \n duress_consent_set := consent_set_change.duress_consent_set \n consent_counter := consent_counter + 1 \n Save set, flag, counter, rotated outcome and outgoing message together before output; enter waiting_receipt. \n Erase the old set and remain paused until receipt.
' Step 17
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationBoomletNisoMessage3 \n consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo
' Step 18
Niso o-> Boomletwo:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoBoomletwoMessage1 \n CONSENT_SET \n consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo
hnote over Boomletwo #Lavender:  consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0 := decrypt_from_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_consent_set", setup_instance_id), \n envelope: consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo)
hnote over Boomletwo #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/consent_set", \n consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0) == True
hnote over Boomletwo #Lavender:  consent_set_change := consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0.content
hnote over Boomletwo #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(st_0_identity_pubkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/st_review", \n consent_set_change.approval) == True \n Assert consent_set_change.approval.content.content == consent_counter \n Assert fixed pair, inactive role, no pending reset \n Assert count(consent_set_change.duress_consent_set) == 5 \n Assert consent_set_change.duress_consent_set contains distinct countries in [1..193]
hnote over Boomletwo #Lavender:  duress_consent_set := consent_set_change.duress_consent_set \n under_duress := under_duress OR consent_set_change.under_duress \n consent_counter := consent_counter + 1 \n consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo := sign_message(boomletwo_Identity_privkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/consent_set_received", sha256(canonical_encode(consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo))) \n consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo_encrypted_by_boomletwo_for_boomlet_0 := encrypt_for_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_consent_set_received", setup_instance_id), \n content: consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo)
hnote over Boomletwo #LavenderBlush:  Boomletwo saves the updated state, exact message and receipt before output, erases the old set and remains inactive.
' Step 19
Boomletwo o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationBoomletwoNisoMessage1 \n consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo_encrypted_by_boomletwo_for_boomlet_0
' Step 20
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoBoomletMessage4 \n CONSENT_SET_RECEIVED \n consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo_encrypted_by_boomletwo_for_boomlet_0
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo := decrypt_from_boomletwo(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_consent_set_received", setup_instance_id), \n envelope: consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo_encrypted_by_boomletwo_for_boomlet_0)
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(boomletwo_Identity_pubkey, "Boomerang/consent_rotation/v1/consent_set_received", \n consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo) == True \n Assert current stage is waiting_receipt \n Assert consent_set_received_signed_by_boomletwo.content == sha256(canonical_encode(consent_set_change_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_boomletwo))
end group

group ST completion
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  consent_rotation_completed_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st := encrypt_for_st(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_completed"), \n content: rotation_id)
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet saves the receipt, complete state, any paused withdrawal's SAR resumption gate and the ST reply before output.
' Step 21
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>ConsentRotationBoomletNisoMessage4 \n consent_rotation_completed_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
' Step 22
Niso o-> ST:  <b>ConsentRotationNisoStMessage3 \n consent_rotation_completed_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
hnote over ST #Lavender:  completed_rotation_id := decrypt_from_boomlet(context: canonical_encode("consent_rotation_completed"), \n envelope: consent_rotation_completed_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st)
hnote over ST #Pink:  Assert completed_rotation_id == rotation_id
hnote over ST #Lavender:  new_consent_counter := consent_rotation_request.content + 1
' Step 23
ST o-> User:  <b>ConsentRotationStOutput4 \n magic: "consent_rotation_completed" \n consent_counter: new_consent_counter
end group

hnote over Boomlet, ST #LavenderBlush:  ST recovery authenticates the pending new-set query before restoring or restarting local entry; counter display keeps the same gate.

opt Resume DIGGING iteration after receipt
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet obtains fresh country input using the installed set and updates under_duress using that input before constructing the next placeholder.
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  user_is_in_duress := under_duress
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet applies ordinary pong processing, sends the next-sequence ping carrying user_is_in_duress and saves its SAR resumption gate before output.
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Keep local DIGGING until that ping's exact SAR receipt, even if WT finishes during rotation. \n Require it before later iteration progress, signing or export; an earlier ping's receipt cannot clear the gate.
end

hnote over Boomlet, Boomletwo #Pink:  Both flag values use identical prompts, message lengths, writes and fixed deadlines; sets, flags and receipts stay encrypted.
@enduml
